[30.333659, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> The theorem states that addition is commutative for natural numbers (forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The proof attempt uses induction but is missing some crucial steps.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Your task is to:"]
