[62.850429, "o", "  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_O.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    rewrite -> plus_n_Sm.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc /tmp/debug.v 2>&1 — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash cat > /tmp/debug.v << 'EOF' Require Import Arith. Theorem debug_plus :…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 18 tool call(s) so far\r\n  │ It compiles. Now let me apply the same fix to the actual file:\r\n[approval] write plus_comm.v (+3 −3) — approved\r\n  ⚙ write plus_comm.v\r\n    ✓ write plus_comm.v (+3 −3)\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 19 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] bash: coqc plus_comm.v 2>&1 — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash coqc plus_comm.v 2>&1\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 20 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] bash: ls -la plus_comm.vo — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash ls -la plus_comm.vo\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 21 tool call(s) so far\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 22 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ todo \r\n    ✓ todo — 3/3 done\r\nThe proof is complete and compiles successfully. Here's what was done:\r\n\r\n**Base case** (`n = 0`): After `simpl`, the goal is `m = m + 0`. The tactic `rewrite <- plus_n_O` rewrites `m + 0` back to `m` (since `plus_n_O : forall n, n = n + 0`), yielding `m = m`, solved by `reflexivity`.\r\n\r\n**Inductive step** (`n = S n'`): After `simpl`, the goal is `S (n' + m) = m + S n'`. First `rewrite IHn'` replaces `n' + m` with `m + n'`, giving `S (m + n') = m + S n'`. Then `rewrite -> plus_n_Sm` (which states `S (n + m) = n + S m`) transforms the left side to `m + S n'`, making both sides identical, solved by `reflexivity`.\r\n\r\nThe compiled proof object `plus_comm.vo` has been generated.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=22 surface=2f77a83e3748\r\n"]
